TITLE Albite dissolution with gas H2S
SOLUTION 1
    temp 200
    pH 2 charge
    Fe(3) 4e-3
    Fe(2) 4e-3
    units mol/kgw
GAS_PHASE 1
    -fixed_pressure
    -pressure 5
    H2S(g) 5
KINETICS 1
    Albite
        -m0 1
        -m  1
        -parms 1.0 10
        -steps 10 in 100
        -cvode
USER_PUNCH
    -head step I
    10 PUNCH KIN_TIME, SC
END